Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.74,0:01:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘多拉的森林中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The forests of Pandora…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.05,0:01:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有许多危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}hold many dangers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.51,0:01:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但潘多拉最危险的一点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the most dangerous thing about Pandora…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你会不知不觉爱上这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that you may grow to love her too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用乐珠来记事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sing the songcords to remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一颗乐珠都是一段故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each bead, a story in our life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.91,0:02:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一颗 纪念儿子出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bead for the birth of our son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.79,0:02:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neteyam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neteyam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一颗是指我们领养的女儿 琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bead when we adopted our daughter, Kiri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她亲生母亲是格蕾丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born of Grace's avatar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.44,0:02:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子的亲生父亲却完全是个迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}A daughter whose conception was a total mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,纪念和艾娃的初次交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bead for the first communion with Eywa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,族人说 我们与艾娃共生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The People say we live in Eywa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.05,0:02:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃也与我们同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Eywa lives in us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母艾娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Great Mother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的心中放着所有的儿女\N{\fnArial\fs30}holds all her children in her heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}syal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happiness is simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受风向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hufwe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能想到一个大兵也懂得幸福呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who would've thought a jarhead like me could crack the code?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏蛋要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Za'u rawm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.12,0:03:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tul!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 我第一次遇见你们父亲时…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.37,0:03:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 还打算要杀他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 那叫一见钟情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我懂了 我已有了四个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I knew it, we had four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天空人被赶回了地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we sent the Sky People back to Earth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下了几个科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few of 'em stayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们喜欢纳威人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science guys, loyal to the Na'vi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个是蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there was Spider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.05,0:03:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蜘蛛 蜘蛛 - 蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spider, Spider… - Spider!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被困在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was just stuck here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.39,0:03:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为太小进不了冷冻舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too young for a cryo-capsule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个小野人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little wild man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 诺姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you, Norm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是战争孤儿 在实验室长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orphaned by the war, he was raised by the lab guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.81,0:03:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 多带点氧气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider, take your spare!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是去村里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going to the village!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:03:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是我们家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't part of our family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就像野猫一样到处游荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was like a stray cat. Just always around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和孩子们打成一片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inseparable from our kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈蒂莉说他永远是外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Neytiri, he would always be alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.79,0:04:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 他应该属于他的种族
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.67,0:04:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 这是我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 我先拿到的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 我为什么要让给你？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脑子笨 花了好几年学纳威语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took a few years to get the language through my thick skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 就是我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 洛阿克 你是骗子！把它给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我听纳威语完全没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now when I hear it, it might as well be English.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.85,0:04:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌你一百一千一万倍 洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hate you times infinity, Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.65,0:04:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penis face!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说脏话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.23,0:04:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就别玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me come over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.99,0:04:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要从那块大石头后面出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna come out from behind those big rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 快去抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Go get it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 奈特亚 你是抓鱼大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Neteyam, the mighty fisherman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:04:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真能干\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Good boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条鱼真大\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在石头后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right where you said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有多高？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How tall is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有这么高 - 他很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's… that tall. - He's tall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间过得真快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes by too fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,像梦一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琪莉 - 哥哥 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kiri. - Bro, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要拍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.65,0:05:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑一笑 傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smile, skxawng.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happiness is simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.53,0:05:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,像约会之夜 没有孩子们打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like date night. Time away from the kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.15,0:05:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是幸福…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the thing about happiness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以在瞬间消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can vanish in a heartbeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜空中多了颗星星\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new star in the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只说明一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could only mean one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船正在减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ships. Decelerating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,天空人回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sky People returning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:59.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉搏168 快要醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulse 168. He's coming up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, here it comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.09,0:09:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静躺着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just lie still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 瞳孔光感反射很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Pupillary reflex is good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别折腾他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that out of his face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听到吗？上校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you hear me? Colonel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 请您躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to lie back down, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.61,0:09:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他打麻醉 麻醉针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sedate him! Sedate him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,走走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快叫保安 - 抓他胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get security! - Grab him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住他 - 按住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grab him! - Hold him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, it's me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,温弗利下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corporal Wainfleet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lyle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.05,0:09:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 这是老狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. And Z Dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是菲克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Fike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right. Let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.77,0:10:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可没想到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't this a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备 还有两分钟进入潘多拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by. Two minutes to Pandora insertion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开始减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure for Delta V.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 脐带分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Umbilical's clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,血氧数值89\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulse ox 89.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.19,0:10:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来说明一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you haven't figured it out yet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.07,0:10:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是迈尔斯·夸里奇上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're Colonel Miles Quaritch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,变年轻了 变高了 变蓝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only younger, taller, bluer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:10:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没原来那么帅气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not nearly as good-lookin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,两小时后 我就要全副武装去空袭纳威人的要塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}In two hours, I fly a mission against the Na'vi's stronghold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.12,0:11:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面的人觉得我应该谨慎些 给自己留个备份\N{\fnArial\fs30}The powers that be thought it prudent that I do this backup…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}just in case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你看到了这段录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you are watchin' it, well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那说明我已经完事大吉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it means that I did get my ticket punched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Parker, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接下来还要说点什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}just what the hell am I supposed to say now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就告诉他复制的流程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just remind him how this works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？ - 这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这个了吗？这里面是你的记忆和人格\N{\fnArial\fs30}So see this? This is all your memories and your personality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.31,0:11:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把这个送回地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna send this back to Earth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 此刻你的身体还泡在培养舱里 - 好了 了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- where you're growing in a lab as we speak. - All right, I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.05,0:11:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这东西放进去就可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna imprint you with it, and then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底是我说还是你说？ - 好的 快说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I doin' this, or are you doin' this? - Hurry it up. Hurry it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.77,0:11:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 克隆我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, the idea is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保存潘多拉项目上最强毅的几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get the minds of the saltiest on-world operators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,比方说 那个是温弗利下士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like Corporal Wainfleet over there and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的谦逊的解说员被装进\N{\fnArial\fs30}your humble narrator into…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,合成的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}recombinant bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个合成体 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a recom now, Colonel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有我的全部记忆和全部的魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}loaded with my memories and my charm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会记得我死过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you won't remember is my death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为老子还没死呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it hasn't happened yet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且也不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it ain't gonna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说得没错 - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn right. - Hell yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever happened, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你就是我 麻烦你替我报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're any clone of mine, you'll be lookin' for some payback.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利是复仇名单的第一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jake Sully would be at the top of that list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.85,0:12:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, kid, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,海军陆战队永不言败\N{\fnArial\fs30}a Marine can't be defeated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你杀死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you can kill us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也能从地狱爬出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'll just regroup in hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.99,0:12:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠诚永在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Semper fi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,地面队 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground team, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上这个 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备 两分钟后 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Two minutes, people. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥 我们也去下面看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro, we have got to get down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.42,0:14:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 爸爸会揍扁我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way! Dad will skin us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来不来 胆小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Don't be a wuss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点回来 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back here, you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.31,0:14:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,连箱子带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking the whole case!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹匣 火箭筒 防空导弹都拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking mags, the RPGs, the stingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哥哥 走 快点 - 洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bro, let's go. Come on! - Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特亚 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 拿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Take that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿好武器 给你 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take these weapons. Here, boy. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西你还不会用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know how to use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸教我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad taught me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,武装直升机 撤开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunship's inbound! Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.72,0:14:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克 你在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neteyam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 你哥哥在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Where's your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那边 - 他在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That way. - Where is he? Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快离开这 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta here! Go on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neteyam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.79,0:15:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.17,0:15:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.47,0:15:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doin' here, boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没长脑子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell were you thinkin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm s… I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.39,0:15:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经不在堪萨斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not in Kansas anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去潘多拉星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to Pandora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们所有人心里都在想同一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're all askin' yourselves the same question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.95,0:15:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么蓝过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why so blue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.63,0:16:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上辈子犯了罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}For our sins in our past life, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在受到惩罚 变成了敌人的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have been brought back in the form of our enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们一样 高大 有力 敏捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gives us their size, their strength, their speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.97,0:16:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 经过训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with our training, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会变得更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's a pretty potent mix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.77,0:16:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有任务吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have a mission yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.31,0:16:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务是找到并且除掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mission is to hunt down and kill{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.98,0:16:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威叛乱行动的首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}the leader of the Na'vi insurgency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威人称他托鲁克马克多（魅影骑士）\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one they call Toruk Makto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.57,0:16:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake Sully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻 进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack, attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.12,0:16:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,打中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got ya!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuk! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我涂成蓝色跑得更快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm definitely faster when I'm blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skxawng.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物也都对我更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the animals respect me more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们认不出我是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't think of me as human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你是人类？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You're human?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.69,0:17:11.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（高地营地 奥马蒂卡雅族堡垒）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.70,0:17:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉 蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiri, Spider!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗小队已经回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war party's coming back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 快来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 图克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - Tuk…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.55,0:17:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 图克 图克 图克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom. - Tuk, Tuk, Tuk, Tuk, Tuk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,列队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的任务是观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be spotters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,空中有异样就叫人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spot bogeys, and you call 'em in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在远处观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a distance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听不懂吗？给我过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does any of this sound familiar? Get here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把重要的任务交给你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. I let you two geniuses fly a mission, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们竟然擅自行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you disobey direct orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉 你去帮外婆照顾伤员 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiri, can you go help your grandmother with the wounded? Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:17:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥就受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother is wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:17:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 孩子 快去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's fine. - Baby girl, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 图克 你也去 去吧 - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tuk, go with her. Go. - Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我 这都是我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir. I take full responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没错 你的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you do. That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you're the older brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得有哥哥的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta act like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.38,0:18:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}MaJake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.09,0:18:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的儿子还在流血呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son is actually bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.01,0:18:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 没关系 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, it's fine. I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.59,0:18:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去包扎吧 原地解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go and get patched up. Go on, dismissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点就把你哥哥害死\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you almost got your brother killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.73,0:18:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被禁飞了 禁飞一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're grounded. No flying for a month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.36,0:18:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去照看伊卡兰 不许偷懒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, see to the ikran. All of 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的脸擦干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get that crap off your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要给你吹吹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, want a kiss on the boo-boo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给他这个 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give him this. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我就用亚娜树\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would use yalna bark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.59,0:18:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you would?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是大祭司？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who is Tsahik?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是您 外婆 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are, Grand… Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是您外婆 可亚娜树的疗效更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are, Grandmother. But yalna bark is better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.14,0:19:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺痛感比较轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stings less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mighty Warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.07,0:19:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特亚和洛阿克想要以你为榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neteyam and Lo'ak try to live up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对他们来说很难的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is very hard on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他们太严厉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are very hard on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是父亲 我有责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm their father. It's my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.67,0:19:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a squad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.14,0:19:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为他们回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we'd lost them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明天再见 - 哎 你们好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll check on this tomorrow. - Hey, man. How's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做个好梦 - 打你的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stream. - Your ass is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.67,0:20:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, bro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.61,0:20:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿凡达以外的人都出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avatars only, go around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 涂一身蓝你也不会长高的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Those blue stripes don't make you any bigger, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你也不是我的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I can still kick your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.77,0:20:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一天过得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真长啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.55,0:20:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,像一只烦人的小虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a little annoying bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.87,0:20:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 都快烦死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real hysterical, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.51,0:20:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,最不公平的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what really sucks though?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.64,0:20:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以呼吸地球空气几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is you can breathe Earth air for hours, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.39,0:20:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我在外面呼吸几秒 就晕过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can only breathe your air for, like, 10 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 小猴子 你可真是不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Monkey Boy, that really sucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 麦克斯 - 你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Max. - Hey, kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.36,0:20:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗 麦克斯 - 你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up, Max? - What up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 诺姆 - 洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up, Norm? - Lo'ak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.50,0:20:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Ma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是我在这儿已经疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm just losing it out here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但真的有证据显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm seeing real evidence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个星球会做出反应来应对刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a systemic response on a global level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.23,0:21:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先不说星球有“智慧” 可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't use the term "intelligence." It's, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.61,0:21:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许可以说它“有意识”\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe "awareness" is a better word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.57,0:21:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像潘多拉星的整个生态圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the entire biosphere of Pandora{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有意识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is aware…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有自己的认知还能做出回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}and capable of this cognitive response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.00,0:21:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 完了 我不能那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap, I can't say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll crucify me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说一些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I need to say something that'll…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.88,0:21:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说 谁让她怀孕的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who do you think knocked her up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.01,0:21:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是诺姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure it was Norm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.35,0:21:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,太对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说你们两个都去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not deserve to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.55,0:21:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 想想看 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Think about it, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.10,0:21:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺曼是个好学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's the teacher's pet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.64,0:21:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天天跟格蕾丝泡在实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out at the lab with her all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.31,0:21:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就还不如自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would kill myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.35,0:21:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者喝毒药死了才好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would drink acid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克说得对 每段录像都有他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro, you're right. He's, like, in every shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:21:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 他还对人家抛媚眼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro, look, look, he's giving her looks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.07,0:22:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I'm thinkin'…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.65,0:22:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他俩的阿凡达出去散步 孤男寡女的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}their two avatars were out in the woods all alone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.07,0:22:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出你的亲生父亲也不一定是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, sometimes it's not so great to know who your father was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.41,0:22:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even remember him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.75,0:22:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蜘蛛 - 行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Spider. - Dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.13,0:22:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是你 他是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.56,0:22:37.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（桥头堡市）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.22,0:23:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,走走走 直接进航空站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go! Directly inside the terminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.93,0:23:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.84,0:23:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.48,0:23:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,摘面罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Masks off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.44,0:23:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 这位是将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, this is the General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.70,0:23:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿德莫尔将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Ardmore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.29,0:23:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to meet you, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.37,0:23:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard good things, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.37,0:23:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你走后 这里变了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a lot's changed since your last tour here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.58,0:23:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.38,0:23:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的指挥中心在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new ops center is over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.76,0:23:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚投入使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That just came online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.72,0:23:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些组装机器人六天就能盖一座建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}These Swarm Assemblers, they can put up a building in six days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.85,0:23:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年一年我们的建设成果比前三十年都多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have done more here in a year than in the previous 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.18,0:24:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是来挖矿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not here to run a mine, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.60,0:24:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为外驻指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}As On-World Commander, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.77,0:24:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接到了更重要的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been charged with a greater mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.20,0:24:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球要完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth is dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.66,0:24:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务是征服前方这片土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our task here is to tame this frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.79,0:24:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说让潘多拉星成为人类新的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing less than to make Pandora the new home for humanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.62,0:24:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是搬进新家之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But before we can do that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.83,0:24:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,得先让这里的敌人闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to pacify the hostiles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.88,0:24:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨利的突袭越来越大胆 也越来越频繁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully's raids are becoming bolder and more frequent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.93,0:24:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都是精心策划\N{\fnArial\fs30}His strikes are well-planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.72,0:24:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的地面和空中行动组配合非常紧密\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got tight coordination between his ground and air assets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.39,0:24:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直在破坏我们的外部设施\N{\fnArial\fs30}His forces are hitting our outlying sites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.39,0:24:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,矿井 管线\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mines, pipelines, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.44,0:24:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,想切断我们的供应链\N{\fnArial\fs30}cutting off our supply chain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.69,0:24:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天前他们袭击了一列磁悬浮列车\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they hit a maglev two days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.78,0:24:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于萨利的指挥中心有什么信息吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any intel on Sully's base of operations?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.70,0:24:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 显示山地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Give me the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.99,0:25:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哈利路亚山一个复杂的岩洞里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cave system in the Hallelujah Mountains somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.17,0:25:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们每次派军队过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But every time we send our forces up there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.21,0:25:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有不少伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}we take losses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.59,0:25:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的设备和武器会激怒那儿的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our hardware really stirs up the hornet's nest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.47,0:25:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入敌方领空不到十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only get 10 minutes in enemy airspace, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.47,0:25:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就都扑上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they are all over us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.97,0:25:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.14,0:25:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为你的蓝军小队可以伪装成土著\N{\fnArial\fs30}we believe your Blue Team will be perceived as indigenous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.27,0:25:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不会引发生态圈的免疫反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will not trigger the immune response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.10,0:25:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么验证这个假说呢 将军？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how might we test that hypothesis, General?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.90,0:25:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们亲自验证\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hard way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.86,0:25:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.75,0:25:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快要进入敌方领空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're entering hostile airspace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.13,0:25:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.22,0:25:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.80,0:26:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, bro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.68,0:26:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,上啊 小猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Monkey Boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.35,0:26:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们大家 等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, wait up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.31,0:26:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克 快点跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuk! Keep up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.56,0:26:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.{\r}
