Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.95,0:34:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.03,0:34:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜻蜓号向左靠近 我们这就去接应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragonfly comin' left, we are go for extract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.04,0:34:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be advised, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.25,0:34:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带回了高价值俘虏\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are bringin' in high value prisoners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.72,0:34:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放我们走 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let us go! - Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.58,0:34:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit tight, Blue One, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.83,0:34:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上赶到\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're inbound to your pos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.29,0:34:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,预计十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bingo in ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.79,0:34:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,按时到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.51,0:34:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐下 - 坐在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit! - Come on, in the dirt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.80,0:34:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 休息 - 坐在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Feet up! - Get down on the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.34,0:34:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱尔 声音再开大一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lyle, get me some audio on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.43,0:35:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭上嘴 - 别看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut your mouth. - Don't look up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.31,0:35:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是萨利的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Sully's woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.77,0:35:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是头野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's an animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.06,0:35:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 夸里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it up, Quaritch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.31,0:35:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.48,0:35:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 战争结束了 - 这个叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all over. - Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.19,0:35:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我活着就不会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothin's over while I'm breathin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.49,0:35:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的就是这句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kinda hoped you'd say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.96,0:35:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静 安静 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down, down, down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.13,0:35:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你和伊卡兰留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, you stay with the ikran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.47,0:35:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.55,0:35:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一样是战士 我应该战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a warrior like you. I'm supposed to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.14,0:35:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neteyam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.22,0:35:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我再说第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna say it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.01,0:35:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.54,0:36:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 到这儿就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there's nothin' after that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.26,0:36:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要帮你收回遗体吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want us to recover these remains?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.08,0:36:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝军一号请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue One, stand by ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.00,0:36:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are three minutes out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.09,0:36:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意了 还有三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up, three minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.48,0:37:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意后方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch our six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.57,0:38:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.38,0:38:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.34,0:38:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,后方有敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contact rear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.55,0:38:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 后方有敌人 - 琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Contact rear! - Kiri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.18,0:38:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.97,0:38:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.98,0:38:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小崽子 - 洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You little shit. - Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.81,0:38:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 图克 来 快 - 给我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tuk, come on. Go, go, go! - Get back here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.40,0:38:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.48,0:38:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.78,0:38:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.82,0:38:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.66,0:38:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.84,0:39:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗 萨利夫人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you, Mrs. Sully?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.10,0:39:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别来无恙啊 神射手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recognize your calling card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.07,0:39:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不来见见老朋友吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come on out, Mrs. Sully?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.45,0:39:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个之间还有不少账要算呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I, we got some unfinished business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.37,0:39:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider, come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.33,0:39:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.83,0:39:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论杀死你多少次我都奉陪到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kill you as many times as I have to!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.63,0:39:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你和杰克·萨利一直挺忙的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you and the Corporal have been pretty busy, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.26,0:39:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙着生了一大堆小崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dropped yourself a whole litter of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.97,0:39:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,混血种\N{\fnArial\fs30}half-breeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.98,0:39:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Na'vi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.61,0:40:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 跑跑跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.32,0:40:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧 孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay? You okay, boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.40,0:40:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.53,0:40:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了吗？好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. With me. Ready? Ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.20,0:40:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.20,0:40:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.49,0:40:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.83,0:40:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.59,0:40:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,走走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.42,0:40:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,散开 追杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flank out. Get after 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.97,0:40:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.31,0:40:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.56,0:40:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琪莉 - 蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kiri! - Spider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.61,0:40:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come! Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.32,0:40:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 他还在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider. He's down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.61,0:40:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.49,0:40:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, we're at bingo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.87,0:40:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照约定 十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten minutes in enemy airspace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.20,0:41:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝军一号 回到接应地点 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue One. Get back to the rally point now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.63,0:41:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝军一号 撤回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue One, fall back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.34,0:41:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.51,0:41:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退 撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back, fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.01,0:41:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,往回撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.85,0:41:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.39,0:41:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琪莉 - 蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kiri! - Spider!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.54,0:41:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.18,0:41:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.60,0:41:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,走走走 快点 走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go. Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.79,0:41:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 受伤了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's okay. You hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.98,0:41:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都没事吧？ - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you hurt? - No, I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.07,0:41:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 图克 你呢？ - 别怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tuk, you hurt? - Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.58,0:41:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.46,0:41:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们安全了 大家都没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're clear. We're clear. Everyone okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.63,0:41:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 图克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - Tuk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.59,0:41:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.47,0:41:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay. We're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.10,0:41:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你圣母 谢谢 感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you, Great Mother. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.89,0:42:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.43,0:42:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Spider?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.81,0:42:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被抓走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.90,0:42:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,被那群人抓走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.44,0:42:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别怕亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. It's all right, baby girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.53,0:42:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很坚强的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? He's a tough kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.49,0:42:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.53,0:42:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.37,0:42:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.46,0:42:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.55,0:42:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.09,0:42:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.89,0:42:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他完全没开化\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's completely feral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.94,0:42:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为自己是纳威人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinks he's one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.32,0:42:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个家伙 夸里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing. This Quaritch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.74,0:42:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.82,0:42:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.91,0:42:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能进到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can walk right in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.03,0:42:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来到艾娃的鼻子底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can walk right under Eywa's nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.12,0:43:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是我们的家 我们的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our family. This is our home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.28,0:43:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我们的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about our family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.37,0:43:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about our little ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.66,0:43:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 你不能这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot. You cannot ask this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.00,0:43:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能离开我们的族人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot leave my People.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.63,0:43:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.21,0:43:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找上我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hunting us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.17,0:43:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他盯上我们一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's targeting our family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.30,0:43:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot ask this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.05,0:43:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.14,0:43:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直生活在这里 这片森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything they've ever known. The forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.47,0:43:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的家就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.76,0:43:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抓了我们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had our children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.10,0:43:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,用刀抵住他们的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had 'em under his knife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.39,0:43:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把弓是我父亲临死前亲手交给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father gave me this bow as he lay dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.24,0:43:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说要保护好族人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he said protect the People.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.62,0:43:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是托鲁克马克多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Toruk Makto!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.45,0:43:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样可以保护族人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will protect the People!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.54,0:43:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,夸里奇抓了蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quaritch has Spider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.91,0:43:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子什么都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that kid knows everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.29,0:43:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他了解我们的全部底细\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows our whole operation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.50,0:43:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以带他们到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he can lead them right in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.75,0:43:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是族人把我们藏起来 他们就会丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the People harbor us, they will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.84,0:43:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.68,0:44:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太突然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I got nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.72,0:44:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no plan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.14,0:44:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我会尽力保护这个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can protect this family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.98,0:44:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.03,0:44:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一件事情不会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.62,0:44:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever we go, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.96,0:44:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的家永远是坚实的堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}this family is our fortress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.10,0:44:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Jake Sully?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.27,0:44:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.23,0:44:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know that you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.27,0:44:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.77,0:44:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,回忆一下他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just form a picture in your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.82,0:44:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是在悬浮山？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it one of the floating mountains?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.24,0:44:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.57,0:45:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在反抗 再等一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fighting us. Give us a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.20,0:45:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.36,0:45:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要有想法 我们就能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just form a thought, and we will see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.66,0:45:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.49,0:45:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我和你一样不喜欢这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't like this any more than you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.83,0:45:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们会藏到哪个部落去？ - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which clans would be harboring him? - I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.13,0:45:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们杀了我好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.20,0:45:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个 能看到他的脑前额叶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this. You're peaking all over the prefrontal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.96,0:45:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不开口我们就会不停地问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna stop until you give us something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.43,0:45:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说他在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.34,0:45:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都说了我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, you buttholes! Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.39,0:45:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.03,0:45:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 我试试换种方式来问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, let me try the personal angle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.03,0:45:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是你儿子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.98,0:46:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太激动了 冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, tiger. Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.95,0:46:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.59,0:46:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是块硬骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, you got heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.80,0:46:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些搞科学的用尽手段逼问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those science pukes leaned on you pretty hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.38,0:46:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你什么也没透露\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you gave them nothin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.05,0:46:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很佩服你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I respect that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.10,0:46:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你也许想要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you might want this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.11,0:47:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈尔斯·夸里奇上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Colonel Miles Quaritch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.45,0:47:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deceased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.12,0:47:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗身亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed in action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.00,0:47:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是夸里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not that man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.79,0:47:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是毕竟我有他的所有记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do have his memories…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.63,0:47:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}enough to know that, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.09,0:47:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定不算是个好父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, he wasn't always the best father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.81,0:47:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是向你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not an apology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.77,0:47:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你爸爸 严格来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your father. Technically, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.23,0:47:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我没有任何亲属关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and I, we're nothin' to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.23,0:47:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.27,0:47:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.53,0:47:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助你离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get you outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.98,0:47:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你背叛杰克·萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna ask you to betray Jake Sully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.41,0:47:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不会的 你很忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you'd never do that. You're loyal, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.08,0:47:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我佩服你的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I admire loyalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.88,0:48:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ride along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.00,0:48:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我只能送你回实验室去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, I gotta give you back to the lab coats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.93,0:48:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我心上的一块石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is like stones in my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.60,0:48:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔瑟姆年轻有智慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tarsem is wise for his years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.44,0:48:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会成为强大的首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be a strong Olo'eyktan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.24,0:48:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧的首领必须死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The leader must die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.32,0:48:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的首领才能诞生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the leader can be born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.12,0:48:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,托鲁克马克多将要消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toruk Makto will disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.67,0:48:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样族人就安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The People will be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.07,0:49:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲要保护家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A father protects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.20,0:49:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他才有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what gives him meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.16,0:49:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个生命结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}One life ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.79,0:49:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个生命开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.97,0:49:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.89,0:49:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋部落有他们自己的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sea clans are a world unto themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.40,0:49:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,几千个大小岛屿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of islands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.90,0:49:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷宫一般的群岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unknown territory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.48,0:49:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以隐没我们的行踪不被敌人发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}into which we could just vanish without a trace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.45,0:49:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we there yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.05,0:50:23.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿瓦特鲁 梅卡伊纳族村庄）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.06,0:51:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别带那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.56,0:51:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}On me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.60,0:51:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.19,0:51:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 友好一点 - 谁…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be nice. - Who…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.02,0:51:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是谁呀？ - 友好一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are they? - Be nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.04,0:51:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他们为何会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know why they are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.05,0:51:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来自哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did they come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.38,0:51:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. Just be cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.42,0:51:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.38,0:51:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西也算尾巴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that supposed to be a tail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.24,0:51:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.45,0:51:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么游泳啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are they supposed to swim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.61,0:52:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 罗克索 奥农\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not. Rotxo, Aonung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.60,0:52:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,特诺瓦里是梅卡伊纳人的首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonowari was the chief of the Metkayina, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.40,0:52:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是岛礁族\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Reef People.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.65,0:52:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你 特诺瓦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I See you, Tonowari.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.03,0:52:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakesully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.36,0:52:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他性格强硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew him as a tough leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.54,0:52:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我担心的不是特诺瓦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't Tonowari I was worried about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.75,0:52:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你 洛纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I See you, Ronal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.50,0:52:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅卡伊纳大祭司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tsahik of the Metkayina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.96,0:52:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你 洛纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I See you, Ronal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.38,0:52:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么来这里 杰克·萨利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you come to us, Jakesully?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.68,0:53:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来寻求庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We seek uturu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.30,0:53:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,庇护？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uturu?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.05,0:53:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我家人的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sanctuary for my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.68,0:53:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们属于海洋部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are Reef People.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.56,0:53:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是森林部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Forest People.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.81,0:53:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的技能在这没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your skills will mean nothing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.06,0:53:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以学习 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we will learn your ways. Am I right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.40,0:53:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.86,0:53:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的胳膊太细\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their arms are thin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.20,0:53:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 他们的尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom. - Their tails…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.70,0:53:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}are weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.79,0:53:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在水里游泳 速度很慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be slow in the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.62,0:53:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些孩子甚至不算是纳威人吧？ - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These children are not even true Na'vi. - Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.88,0:53:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是纳威人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.63,0:53:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有恶魔的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have demon blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.06,0:53:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看呢 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.35,0:53:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来是天空人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I was born of the Sky People, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.64,0:53:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我成了纳威人 可以适应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now I am Na'vi. All right? You can adapt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.26,0:53:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会适应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will adapt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.94,0:53:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.60,0:54:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫曾经是托鲁克马克多\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband was Toruk Makto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.91,0:54:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带领部落取得了胜利…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He led the clans to victory…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.58,0:54:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,打败了天空人\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the Sky People.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.75,0:54:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这是胜利的样子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This you call victory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.12,0:54:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑来这里求助陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiding among strangers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.09,0:54:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来艾娃已经不再眷顾你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems Eywa has turned her back on you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.72,0:54:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chosen One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.93,0:54:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替我的妻子道歉 她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize for my mate. She's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.77,0:54:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你用不着替我道歉 - 她一路飞行了很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do not apologize for me. - flown a long way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.45,0:54:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她有些累了 - 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and she's exhausted. - Jake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.78,0:54:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,托鲁克马克多是伟大的战争英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toruk Makto is a great war leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.20,0:54:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威人都知道他的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Na'vi people know his story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.03,0:54:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅卡伊纳现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we Metkayina…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.57,0:54:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 没有战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad. - are not at war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.87,0:54:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不会让你把战争带到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot let you bring your war here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.79,0:54:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不打仗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done with war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.83,0:54:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.42,0:55:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想保证家人的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to keep my family safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.84,0:55:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们请求你们的庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uturu has been asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.77,0:55:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要被赶走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.84,0:55:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.41,0:55:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,托鲁克马克多和他的家人可以留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toruk Makto and his family will stay with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.12,0:55:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要像对待兄弟姐妹一样对他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treat them as our brothers and sisters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.91,0:55:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还不了解海洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, they do not know the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.62,0:55:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在就像婴儿一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they will be like babies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.34,0:55:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次睁开眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking their first breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.84,0:55:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要教他们学习水之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teach them our ways, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.92,0:55:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们不至于对自己毫无用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they do not suffer the shame of being{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.18,0:55:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到惭愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.26,0:55:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what do we say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.56,0:55:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.68,0:55:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.02,0:55:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.56,0:55:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子奥农 我女儿喜芮亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son, Aonung, our daughter, Tsireya, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.31,0:55:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责教你们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}will show your children what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.61,0:56:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 为什么… - 就这样定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Father, why do… - It is decided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.11,0:56:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我带你们去村子看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come. I will show you our village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.29,0:56:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.17,0:56:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuk, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.71,0:56:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.50,0:56:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.39,0:56:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边是你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.39,0:56:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的新家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your new home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.77,0:56:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 这不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this will work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.77,0:56:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.02,0:56:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.58,0:56:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨利家 集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Sullys, fall in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.87,0:56:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？ 开家庭会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember? Family meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.70,0:56:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 都坐下 动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Take a knee. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.83,0:56:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.25,0:57:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.33,0:57:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.17,0:57:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几天你们几个要表现得好一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you kids on your best behavior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.80,0:57:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.46,0:57:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,学快点 多干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learn fast. Pull your weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.97,0:57:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't cause trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.45,0:57:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.43,0:57:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.14,0:57:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.85,0:57:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Tuk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.10,0:57:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuk, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.81,0:57:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是家\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is our home now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.86,0:57:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要挺过这一关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're gonna get through this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.36,0:57:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要互相支持 一定可以挺过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get through this if we have each other's backs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.03,0:57:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.53,0:57:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸平时都怎么说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does your father always say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.16,0:57:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人不能分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sullys stick together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.75,0:57:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 一家人不能分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Sullys stick together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.12,0:57:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说得有力量一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this time with some feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.92,0:57:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.17,0:57:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人不能分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sullys stick together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.38,0:57:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人不能分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sullys stick together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.63,0:57:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人不能分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sullys stick together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.18,0:58:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.90,0:59:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 和我们一起游泳吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.15,1:00:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 他们怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.82,1:00:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 那些家伙不会潜水
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.65,1:00:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.32,1:00:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 他们还在学习
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.29,1:00:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.50,1:00:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们游得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.09,1:00:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.09,1:00:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,调整呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.30,1:00:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.43,1:00:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们潜水不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not good divers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.26,1:00:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在树上倒还行 可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe good at swinging through trees, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.10,1:00:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.22,1:00:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看不懂你们用的手语\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't speak this finger talk, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.35,1:00:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不懂你们说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what you're saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.85,1:00:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会教你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will teach you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.94,1:00:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琪莉在哪儿？ - 琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is Kiri? - Kiri?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.52,1:00:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？ - 琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Kiri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.61,1:00:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去哪儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Kiri?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.69,1:00:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到她了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.70,1:01:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他们上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on the ship, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.37,1:01:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖坐着 不要碍别人事\N{\fnArial\fs30}find a seat, and keep out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.04,1:01:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备运输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready for transport!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.42,1:01:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.17,1:01:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻利点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chop-chop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.25,1:01:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.12,1:01:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 小机灵鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on there, hotshot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.01,1:01:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.26,1:01:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你戴的面罩里装了追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a tracker built in that mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.64,1:01:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,落地之后你要是敢逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hit the ground, and you take off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.81,1:01:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我两分钟就能把你抓回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have you back in two minutes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.14,1:01:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就要好好抽你一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will give you a old-school ass-whippin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.89,1:01:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,听明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.02,1:01:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.65,1:01:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.19,1:01:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.36,1:01:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,集结完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team's up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.92,1:01:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.42,1:01:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利已经跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake Sully's gone to ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.13,1:01:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.30,1:01:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever he is, we'll find him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.84,1:02:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能顺便找到他那个疯老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his batshit crazy wife, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.22,1:02:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do so, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.60,1:02:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要变成纳威人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we go Na'vi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.02,1:02:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头到脚都要变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full tilt, all the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.35,1:02:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说像纳威人一样进食\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means we eat Na'vi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.69,1:02:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,像纳威人一样骑行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ride Na'vi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.94,1:02:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,像纳威人一样思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think Na'vi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.10,1:02:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 而且要开始说纳威人的语言
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.07,1:02:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 你这样也叫说纳威话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.49,1:02:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 你听起来就像是三岁小孩！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.41,1:02:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大学问家呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, smart guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.54,1:02:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起你从吉祥物小猴子升为官方翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just went from bein' our monkey mascot to official interpreter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.97,1:02:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是伊鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are ilu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.85,1:02:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,想在这儿活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to live here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.68,1:02:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得骑他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.10,1:02:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢建立连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the bond gently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.77,1:02:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受它的呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel his breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.65,1:03:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受它的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel his strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.32,1:03:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.45,1:03:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at his legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.91,1:03:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.22,1:03:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 森林小子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, Forest Boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.61,1:03:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是战士的坐骑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a warrior's mount.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.32,1:03:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不容易驾驭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not easy to master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.82,1:03:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.49,1:03:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,先学会骑伊鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}start with an ilu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.07,1:03:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 就这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. This one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.45,1:03:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now remember, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.25,1:03:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜入水下时找好位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you dive back in, good position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.71,1:03:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这非常重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.94,1:04:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.14,1:04:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.07,1:04:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持这样 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.49,1:04:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.96,1:04:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.00,1:05:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love her already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.91,1:06:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.21,1:06:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呼气\N{\fnArial\fs30}And breathe out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.92,1:06:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象用气息扰动火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine flickering a flame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.13,1:06:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让心跳逐渐变得舒缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must slow down your heartbeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.68,1:06:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.97,1:06:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,从腹部这里呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe from down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.64,1:06:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢呼气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe out slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.77,1:06:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克 你的心跳很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak, your heartbeat is fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.48,1:06:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Try to focus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.28,1:06:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 吸气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Breathe in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.74,1:06:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼气\N{\fnArial\fs30}And breathe out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.66,1:06:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,排除所有杂念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let your mind go clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.11,1:06:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是正确的呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are learning to breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.73,1:07:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 没吃饭是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Keep up, losers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.16,1:07:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.04,1:07:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.25,1:07:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威小孩不用武器就能驯服伊卡兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Na'vi kids younger than me do this with their bare hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.30,1:07:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利也没用武器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake Sully did it the hard way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.01,1:07:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.77,1:07:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么做 上校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doin', Colonel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.94,1:07:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下有好戏看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.32,1:07:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, move up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.99,1:08:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们俩玩玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you and me, cupcake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.05,1:08:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是忘说了要先把它的嘴绑上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I mention you're supposed to tie the mouth shut first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.34,1:08:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot, kid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.73,1:08:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move up, move up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.69,1:08:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see 'em?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.01,1:08:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 去别的地方看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go. We're Oscar Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.84,1:09:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.64,1:09:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. We're outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.14,1:09:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.61,1:09:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.32,1:09:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 上校 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Colonel! Get some!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.07,1:09:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Colonel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.20,1:09:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个谁来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's up next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.16,1:09:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,水之道无穷无尽 无始无终\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way of water has no beginning and no end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.42,1:09:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋包围着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sea is around you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.05,1:09:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,充盈着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.35,1:09:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋是你的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sea is your home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.48,1:09:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,它见证你到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}before your birth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.23,1:09:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也目送你归去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and after your death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.78,1:10:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的心脏在世界的子宫中跳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our hearts beat in the womb of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.83,1:10:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的呼吸在黑暗的深海中灼烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our breath burns in the shadows of the deep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.50,1:10:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋给予一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sea gives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.71,1:10:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也剥夺一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the sea takes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.51,1:10:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,水连接世间万物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water connects all things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.60,1:10:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,从生到死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.60,1:10:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,从黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darkness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.27,1:10:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,到光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}to light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.23,1:10:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.52,1:10:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喜芮亚 - 你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tsireya! - You did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.08,1:10:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 用它可以在水下呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.21,1:11:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is she doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.97,1:11:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.13,1:11:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她干嘛盯着沙子看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just looking at the sand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.43,1:11:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.97,1:11:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你是不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you some kind of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.84,1:11:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪胎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}freak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.43,1:11:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他问你是不是怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked if you are a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.34,1:11:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.69,1:12:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.92,1:12:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长得都不像纳威人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're not even real Na'vi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.24,1:12:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at these hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.86,1:12:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么多一根手指…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.32,1:12:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边儿去 臭鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off, fishlips!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.87,1:12:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一个手指畸形的怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, another four-fingered freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.29,1:12:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看 他那根小尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at his little baby tail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.66,1:12:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别碰我 - 小尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't touch me! - Aw, baby tail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.50,1:12:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我们远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.12,1:12:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.33,1:12:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看他的尾巴 - 可怜的小尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at his tail. - Aw, baby tail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.29,1:12:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is so cute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.88,1:12:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没听见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard what she said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.97,1:12:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,离他们远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave them alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.68,1:12:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 是大哥哥来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, big brother come…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.05,1:12:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.51,1:12:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.52,1:12:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.31,1:12:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from now on, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.90,1:12:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我妹妹放尊重一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to respect my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.86,1:12:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.16,1:12:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.91,1:12:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.08,1:12:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是畸形\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all freaks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.25,1:12:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家子怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.54,1:13:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洛阿克 - 我跟他们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lo'ak. - I got this, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.38,1:13:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手确实很怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this hand is funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.97,1:13:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我是怪胎 外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm a freak. An alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.93,1:13:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的手也很有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it can do something really cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.89,1:13:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.06,1:13:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以紧紧握住 像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, I ball it up real tight like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.48,1:13:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗？然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.90,1:13:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好了 这叫拳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a punch, bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.11,1:13:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后不许再欺负我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever touch my sister again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.03,1:13:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥农 揍他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aonung! Show him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.66,1:13:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.33,1:13:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.58,1:13:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.84,1:13:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So stupid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.34,1:13:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow, my tail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.30,1:13:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的耳朵 放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ear! Let go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.72,1:13:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抓住我的耳朵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got my ear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.77,1:14:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么跟你们说的 还记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the one thing I asked? The one thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.23,1:14:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要惹麻烦 - 不要惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay out of trouble. - Stay out of trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.61,1:14:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - It was my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.69,1:14:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.82,1:14:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别替他背黑锅 你这个蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta stop takin' the heat for this knucklehead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.57,1:14:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 爸爸 奥农欺负琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dad. Aonung was picking on Kiri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.03,1:14:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,管她叫怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called her a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.08,1:14:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去向奥农道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go apologize to Aonung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.79,1:14:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.95,1:14:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是首领的儿子 你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the chief's son. Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.83,1:14:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么样 你去和他和好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care how you do it. Just go make peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.00,1:14:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.13,1:14:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们赢了还是输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what'd the other guys look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.30,1:14:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.01,1:14:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.60,1:14:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.89,1:14:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.70,1:14:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.78,1:14:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.74,1:14:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有什么不好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I not be fine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.96,1:15:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我不能像其他人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't I just be like everyone else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.78,1:15:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.54,1:15:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,森林小子在这干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's tree boy doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.85,1:15:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起我打了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I hit you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.81,1:15:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还把你打得那么惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.49,1:15:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,交个朋友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.61,1:15:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come hunting with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.32,1:15:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,去礁石外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside the reef.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.28,1:15:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人打猎的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where the men hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.87,1:15:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我爸爸不让去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. I'm not allowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.12,1:15:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问错人了 应该问你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be asking the wrong brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.83,1:15:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.89,1:16:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.53,1:16:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上 森林小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep up, Forest Boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.74,1:16:24.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（三兄弟岩）
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.30,1:16:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you lived!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.38,1:16:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一趟太刺激了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was insane, cuz!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.05,1:16:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.18,1:16:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你去个好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a good spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.23,1:16:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 召唤鱼群
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.87,1:17:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 真是个笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.52,1:17:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.86,1:17:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥农\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aonung!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.40,1:17:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来吧 别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, this isn't funny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.96,1:17:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥农\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Aonung!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.88,1:21:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.21,1:21:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是图鲲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a tulkun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.96,1:22:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.67,1:22:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.09,1:22:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.93,1:22:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 你说什么我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, I have no idea what you just said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.94,1:22:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把你弄伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hurt you, didn't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.90,1:22:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try to pull it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.70,1:22:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trust me, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.90,1:23:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.53,1:23:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, we're friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.03,1:23:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.64,1:23:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.60,1:24:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.40,1:25:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了 小丫头？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is it, baby girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.36,1:25:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,想蜘蛛了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missin' Spider?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.91,1:25:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.03,1:25:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是为这个哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.83,1:25:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.66,1:25:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是为什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.88,1:25:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel her, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.88,1:25:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉到谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.63,1:25:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eywa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.35,1:25:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到她的呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear her breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.22,1:25:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到她的心跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear her heartbeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.18,1:25:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她离我那么近\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's so close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.81,1:25:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她却在在那儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.98,1:25:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,像一句要说出口的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a word about to be spoken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.74,1:26:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定觉得我已经疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think I'm crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.37,1:26:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有疯 好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not crazy, baby girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.75,1:26:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃的心跳是什么样的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what does Eywa's heartbeat sound like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.18,1:26:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mighty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.18,1:26:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再对他说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him what you told me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.44,1:26:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢看星星？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like lookin' at the stars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.36,1:26:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸就是从星星上来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, my dad came from a star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.66,1:26:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.74,1:26:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.25,1:26:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.29,1:26:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 这下可惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. I'm in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.67,1:26:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 我们以后再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. I will see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.11,1:27:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孩子回来了 - 萨利家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The boy has returned! - It is the Sully boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.24,1:27:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他回来了 - 回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They found the boy. - They found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.48,1:27:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.80,1:27:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have a look at you. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.54,1:27:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine. He's fine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.92,1:27:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 只有一点擦伤 - 洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- yeah. Just a few scratches. - Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.96,1:27:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再敢乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray for the strength that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.32,1:27:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我不把你的两只眼睛挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not pluck the eyeballs out of my youngest son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.18,1:27:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.64,1:27:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子很清楚不应该带他去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son knows better than to take him outside the reef.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.68,1:27:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事怪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blame is his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.68,1:27:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.60,1:27:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.06,1:27:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是奥农的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not Aonung's fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.02,1:27:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was my idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.44,1:28:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥农还劝我别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aonung tried to talk me out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.90,1:28:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.57,1:28:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.66,1:28:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.82,1:28:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.62,1:28:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.58,1:28:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.83,1:28:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.50,1:28:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥农 你在想什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aonung. What were you thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.80,1:28:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你说过要和他们做朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you told me to make friends with these kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.93,1:28:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是想和他们一起… - 我不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's all I was trying to… - I don't want to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.93,1:28:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.10,1:28:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我们都跟着你丢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought shame to this family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.89,1:28:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能走了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I go now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.56,1:28:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,再惹麻烦我就把你尾巴剁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any more trouble, I jerk a knot in your tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.31,1:28:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.98,1:28:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官 听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Lima Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.49,1:28:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.62,1:28:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.99,1:28:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.08,1:28:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不看着点你弟弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to "keep an eye on your brother"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.62,1:28:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.25,1:29:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么帮我说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you speak for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.30,1:29:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很清楚父母对你失望是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I know what it's like to be one big disappointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.93,1:29:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想亲眼看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I'd been there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.93,1:29:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次经历是大海送你的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ocean blessed you with a gift, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.56,1:29:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是图鲲今年还没有洄游\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tulkun have not returned yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.06,1:29:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他们从来不单独行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anyway, no tulkun is ever alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.81,1:29:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他落单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this one was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.82,1:29:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它身上少了一只鳍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a missing fin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.78,1:29:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边的鳍断掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a stump. On the left side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.25,1:29:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor tulkun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.40,1:29:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payakan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.24,1:29:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 是帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's Payakan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.41,1:29:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕亚坎是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Payakan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.08,1:29:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只年轻的图鲲\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young bull who went rogue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.91,1:29:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被同伴赶出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's outcast. Alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.04,1:29:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还断了一只鳍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he has a missing fin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.33,1:29:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,都说帕亚坎会杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say he is a killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.00,1:29:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 - 他杀了纳威人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no. - He killed Na'vi, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.00,1:29:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还杀别的图鲲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and other tulkun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.38,1:29:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是在这 在很远的南边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here, but far to the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.34,1:29:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 它不会这样 - 洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, he's no killer. - Lo'ak, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.05,1:29:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能活下来就很幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are lucky to be alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.72,1:29:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.14,1:29:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.97,1:29:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.68,1:29:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}My baby bro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.02,1:29:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢的小战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mighty Warrior{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.60,1:29:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遇到杀人图鲲\N{\fnArial\fs30}who faced the killer tulkun, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.84,1:30:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还平安回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lived to tell about it, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.19,1:30:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们根本没听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys aren't listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.23,1:30:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克 我听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak, I'm listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.61,1:30:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak, come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.45,1:30:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You skxawngs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.86,1:30:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payakan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.95,1:30:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payakan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.37,1:30:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payakan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.09,1:30:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.43,1:30:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么被赶出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you outcast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.22,1:30:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.68,1:30:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 太痛苦了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.10,1:30:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.94,1:30:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.86,1:31:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro, that's disgusting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.57,1:31:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 游快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.70,1:32:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.54,1:32:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们管这里叫仙祖湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Cove of the Ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.83,1:32:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们最神圣的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our most sacred place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.46,1:32:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,日蚀之前这里的景色是最美的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eclipse is the best time of day to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.73,1:32:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.32,1:32:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是灵魂树\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Spirit Tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.51,1:33:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我美丽的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My beautiful daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.51,1:34:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Ma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.47,1:34:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你 我太高兴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so happy to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.81,1:34:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像有心事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you look troubled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.27,1:34:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sweet girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.19,1:34:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.12,1:34:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.70,1:34:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我和别人不一样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I different?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.71,1:34:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母艾娃到底想告诉我什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does the Great Mother want from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.55,1:34:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.14,1:34:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.98,1:34:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.45,1:35:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Kiri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.79,1:35:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.50,1:35:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉怎么了？出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.67,1:35:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是癫痫发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a seizure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.38,1:35:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有呼吸吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she breathing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.84,1:35:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有呼吸吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she breathing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.55,1:35:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她回村里去 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her to the village! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.60,1:35:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Let's move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.85,1:35:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuk, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.98,1:35:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.20,1:35:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿设备 奈特亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the gear. Neteyam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.45,1:35:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特亚 让他们别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neteyam, keep them back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.62,1:35:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.70,1:35:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在还昏迷着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still unconscious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.25,1:35:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no bleed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.08,1:35:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有骨折\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no fracture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.21,1:35:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有缺氧的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}No effects of hypoxia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.92,1:35:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脑没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brain looks good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.31,1:36:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在她的前额叶仍然有癫痫发作时候的放电现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we still have this interictal activity right here in the prefrontal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.78,1:36:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 她确实癫痫发作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - She's definitely had a seizure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.76,1:36:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该可以排除是中毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we can rule out toxins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.10,1:36:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.27,1:36:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until this point…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.35,1:36:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我不需要待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see that I am not needed here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.56,1:36:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你是大祭司\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Tsahik!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.86,1:36:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些东西拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.07,1:36:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 这些都没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out! You have done nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.03,1:36:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 走吧 我们休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. Let's just take a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.36,1:36:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我把静脉针取了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hold on. I gotta take her IV off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.00,1:36:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说自己能够感受到艾娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said that she can feel Eywa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.21,1:36:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听到她的心跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can hear her heartbeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.55,1:36:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.51,1:36:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是典型的前额叶癫痫症状\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is classic frontal lobe epilepsy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.51,1:36:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 癫痫？ - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Epilepsy? - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.68,1:36:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,会看到幻想 还会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see visions. You get…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.36,1:36:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻想神明在对自己说话 像她现在这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}states of religious ecstasy like the kind she's describing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.40,1:37:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这次发病的原因是意识连接灵魂树导致的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pluggin' into the Spirit Tree is some sort of a trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.98,1:37:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后绝对不能再让她这么干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You definitely can't let her do that anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.36,1:37:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Ever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.24,1:37:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.82,1:37:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次她在水里发作癫痫\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she seizes underwater again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.33,1:37:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能就会丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}it could kill her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.59,1:37:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.13,1:37:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're awake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.89,1:37:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Kiri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.02,1:37:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiri, my sweet child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.35,1:37:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的好女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my sweet little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.65,1:37:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说这句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.73,1:37:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I See you."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.03,1:37:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳阿提 纳阿提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ngaati. Ngaati!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.03,1:37:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I just said, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.45,1:37:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是纳提 是纳阿提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not "Naati. Ngaati."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.74,1:37:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳阿提 纳阿提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ngaati, ngaati.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.04,1:37:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了 像从鼻子里擤出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Like comin' out your nose or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.04,1:37:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.92,1:38:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,远程侦察队发现雷达信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}long-range patrol picked up a radar hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.96,1:38:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一架武装直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rogue gunship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.30,1:38:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.46,1:38:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,东海 向北四百公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eastern sea. Four hundred klicks north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.97,1:38:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.64,1:38:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个信号时断时续\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signal was intermittent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.52,1:38:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入开阔水域就消失了 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they lost it over open water but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.39,1:38:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,从它的方向来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you project the track, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.15,1:38:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的目的地是这片群岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}it hits this island group.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.07,1:38:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有几百个岛屿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's hundreds of islands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.11,1:38:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那么多村子 太难找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a big search box with lots of villages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.36,1:38:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.28,1:38:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你给我船只和飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me ships and aircraft, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.66,1:38:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能抓他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring you back his scalp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.42,1:38:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不明物体靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bogies inbound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.50,1:38:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skipper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.76,1:38:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都停下 - 都停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All stop. - All stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.43,1:38:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,都停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All stop. Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.16,1:39:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是索克斯比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Scoresby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.79,1:39:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说有个混蛋要征用我的船 是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the asshole who's commandeering my ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.25,1:39:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.00,1:39:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这次的目标是这一片群岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The target's pretty much this whole island group.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.80,1:39:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never been up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.18,1:39:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解这里 博士 都有哪些土著？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know those waters, doc. What kinda indigenous we got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.18,1:39:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要是梅卡伊那人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metkayina, mostly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.64,1:39:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有坦努伊人 大概五十个村子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some Ta'unui. Maybe fifty villages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.76,1:39:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.38,1:39:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是伊安·加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ian Garvin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.11,1:39:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋生物学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marine biologist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.61,1:39:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,五十个村子也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty villages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.79,1:39:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百个也好 都无所谓 全搜一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred villages. I don't care. We'll search 'em all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.36,1:39:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是图鲲猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hunt tulkun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.36,1:39:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘船是捕猎船 船员都是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm rigged for. That's all my guys do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.78,1:39:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要完成指标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got quotas to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.58,1:40:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这礼貌是装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be nice once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.25,1:40:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别当真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.46,1:40:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 既然没得选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you can't get out of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.17,1:40:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}get into it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.05,1:40:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有船员就位 - 哎 别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All crews to stations! - Hey, don't touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.93,1:40:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备起飞 飞行速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helm, bring her up. Flight speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.68,1:40:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行速度 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flight speed, aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.08,1:40:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.11,1:40:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们来了 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're coming! - What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.53,1:40:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是图鲲回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tulkun have returned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.49,1:40:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家听着 我们的兄弟姐妹回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, our Brothers and Sisters have returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.75,1:40:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,每年图鲲都会迁徙\N{\fnArial\fs30}In their endless cycle of migration, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.26,1:40:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在它们回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the tulkun had come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.93,1:40:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I See you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.14,1:41:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.52,1:41:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉 你来看 来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiri, come on. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.10,1:41:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克 别来烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuk, leave me alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.48,1:41:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快来呀 - 干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.73,1:41:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.98,1:41:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.53,1:41:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.41,1:41:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go meet them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.12,1:41:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.20,1:41:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的心灵姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's my Spirit Sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.67,1:42:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 姐姐 我看见你
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.34,1:42:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 我看见你 妹妹 我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.89,1:42:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 你的儿子很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.77,1:42:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 谢谢 你的孩子怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.40,1:42:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 我的孩子很强壮
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.62,1:42:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 我遇见一个男孩
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.87,1:42:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会分享故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a time for stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.67,1:42:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲述分开的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of their season apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.75,1:42:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡 新生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of deaths and births.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.63,1:42:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,老朋友 新爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of old friends and new loves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.27,1:43:19.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（坦努伊村）
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.82,1:43:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.44,1:43:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be calm, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.62,1:43:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,族人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.12,1:43:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找武器 通讯设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for weapons, comms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.33,1:43:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何科技装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any kind of tech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.79,1:43:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.87,1:43:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 你看到了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too. You see this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.37,1:43:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.63,1:43:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down and shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.21,1:43:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 这个人…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.88,1:43:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 我们知道他就在这些岛屿里面
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.05,1:43:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 在这里吗？这个村子吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.42,1:43:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 我们完全是不同的氏族…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.26,1:43:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 影像中的这个人…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.05,1:43:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 来自森林
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.52,1:43:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what's he saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.73,1:43:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,说没看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.81,1:43:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是海洋部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are Sea People.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.90,1:43:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有森林里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forest People don't come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.69,1:43:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不信这一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't buyin' that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.69,1:44:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 他应该离开这里…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.94,1:44:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 到森林里去找那个人
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.12,1:44:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.50,1:44:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,毙了那畜牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot that animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.38,1:44:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.97,1:44:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.80,1:44:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 冷静
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.68,1:44:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你现在听懂了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, your ears workin' now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.97,1:44:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 冷静！冷静！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.56,1:44:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,见识到它的厉害了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what these can do, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.61,1:44:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake Sully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.90,1:44:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,托鲁克马克多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toruk Makto!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.69,1:44:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 他已经说了他什么都不知道！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.07,1:44:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干掉她 - 跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put her down! - Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.66,1:44:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.91,1:44:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.99,1:44:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.08,1:44:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你现在去和他说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make it real clear to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.21,1:44:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不交出杰克·萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't give up Sully, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.87,1:44:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就杀了大祭司\N{\fnArial\fs30}we kill the Tsahik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.54,1:44:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我才不去说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not doin' that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.00,1:45:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.63,1:45:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要干这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna be a part of this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.34,1:45:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.80,1:45:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people don't know anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.38,1:45:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.76,1:45:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不许动 - 跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't move! - Stay down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.76,1:45:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.35,1:45:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要干掉她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really gonna waste her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.52,1:45:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 求你别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.02,1:45:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.19,1:45:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这样做不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're doing here is wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.32,1:45:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.57,1:45:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把村子烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn the hooches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.78,1:45:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 点火吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, light 'em up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.45,1:45:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,点火 都烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light 'em up. All of 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.41,1:45:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用喷火器 - 点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Flamethrowers up! - Light 'em up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.13,1:45:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 对不起！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.96,1:45:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 我不知道会这样！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.92,1:45:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语] 让他们住手！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.01,1:45:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.56,1:45:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.48,1:45:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.02,1:45:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.10,1:46:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.48,1:46:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备出发 - 好吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Saddle up. - All right. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.97,1:46:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.13,1:46:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是天空人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sky People.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.97,1:46:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're looking for you, Jakesully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.22,1:46:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在南边\N{\fnArial\fs30}South.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.31,1:46:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着一个会说纳威语的人类男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a human boy who speaks Na'vi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.23,1:46:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀人了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they kill anybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.44,1:46:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.11,1:46:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They threaten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.61,1:46:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放心 我们的人不会透露你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the villagers will not tell them where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.41,1:46:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下了命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}By my order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.46,1:47:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要找到这个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must hunt this demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.04,1:47:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,困住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trap him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.25,1:47:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.97,1:47:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要小心行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gotta be smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.80,1:47:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要聪明些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta be smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.83,1:47:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果攻击夸里奇 就会暴露我们的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we hit Quaritch, they're gonna know where we are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.93,1:47:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就会倾其所有大举进攻这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're gonna come here with everything they've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.64,1:47:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what is our plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.68,1:47:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是托鲁克马克多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Toruk Makto!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.06,1:47:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头低下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.81,1:47:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来过这儿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he been here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.82,1:47:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样问没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This shit ain't workin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.86,1:47:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他们在耍我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, they're stonewallin' us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.91,1:47:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追得太紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we turn up the heat, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.16,1:47:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克只会继续跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's just gonna keep runnin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.24,1:47:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,得逼他出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta draw him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.17,1:47:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.46,1:47:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要完成指标呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got quotas to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.80,1:47:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想打猎吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.76,1:47:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.80,1:47:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 在这儿？不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Here? Not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.43,1:47:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,人太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many villages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.81,1:47:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这样不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.60,1:48:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respectfully, sir, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.44,1:48:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不理解图鲲和海洋部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}you do not understand the kinship bonds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.61,1:48:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威人之间的深切联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}between the tulkun and the ocean Na'vi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.44,1:48:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死图鲲就像杀害他们的家人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be like murdering a member of their family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.82,1:48:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是在这杀图鲲\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we start hunting here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.28,1:48:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没多久 敌人就会找上门来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the hostiles will come after us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.57,1:48:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.36,1:48:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想见见其中一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hostile in particular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.79,1:48:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how you feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.22,1:48:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我也很孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel all alone too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.14,1:48:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.60,1:48:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么被赶走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you outcast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.07,1:51:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.12,1:51:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.58,1:51:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.25,1:51:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.72,1:51:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You allowed this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.73,1:51:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着他和那个图鲲建立心灵纽带\N{\fnArial\fs30}You allowed him to bond with the outcast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.28,1:51:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜芮亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tsireya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.65,1:51:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是让我太失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disappoint me, daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.57,1:51:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.99,1:51:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是英雄的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}son of a great warrior, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.45,1:51:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该明白事理才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has been taught better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.12,1:51:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕亚坎救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payakan saved my life, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.79,1:51:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,您不了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.95,1:51:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Lo'ak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.37,1:51:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.79,1:51:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.92,1:51:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,都坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.39,1:52:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认真听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear my words, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.81,1:52:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在初始之歌的年代\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the days of the First Songs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.56,1:52:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,图鲲彼此之间一直在争斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}tulkun fought amongst themselves, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.10,1:52:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}for territory, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.31,1:52:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.65,1:52:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们逐渐意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they came to believe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.69,1:52:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮 无论其理由多么正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}that killing, no matter how justified, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.45,1:52:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会带来更多的杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}only brings more killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.95,1:52:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是 所有杀戮被禁止\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all killing was forbidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.41,1:52:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是图鲲的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Tulkun Way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.92,1:52:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payakan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.33,1:52:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀害了同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a killer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.83,1:52:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.12,1:52:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被驱逐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is outcast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.71,1:52:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.96,1:52:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您说得不对 - 洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But you're wrong. - Lo'ak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.63,1:52:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在对首领说话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak to Olo'eyktan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.84,1:52:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道我… - 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know what I… - That's enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.98,1:52:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.65,1:52:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.69,1:53:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来教训他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll deal with this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.62,1:53:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风雨会过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This storm will pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.62,1:53:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.16,1:53:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天已经看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw something today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.75,1:53:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个森林男孩被图鲲选中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a Forest Boy chosen by tulkun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.79,1:53:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从心底为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very proud of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.50,1:53:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕亚坎没有杀同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payakan didn't kill those boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.09,1:53:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.26,1:53:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔船当着它的面杀了它妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon ship killed his mother right in front of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.05,1:53:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它召集年轻图鲲和岛礁人去进攻恶魔船\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gathered the young bulls and the reef boys together to attack the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.18,1:53:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都被杀死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they were all killed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.56,1:53:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手是天空人不是帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}but by the Sky People. Not by him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.64,1:53:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它没有杀戮 - 不 洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not a killer. - No, Lo'ak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.65,1:53:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,图鲲认为这就是杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the Tulkun Way, he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.15,1:53:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要对同伴负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bears those deaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.40,1:53:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要用一辈子来赎罪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he have to pay for it for the rest of his life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.94,1:53:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它知道自己错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows what he did was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.15,1:53:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不会再犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would never do it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.07,1:53:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得告诉我父亲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must tell my father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.16,1:53:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.02,1:53:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我爸之间的麻烦已经够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in enough trouble with my dad already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.66,1:53:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲会理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father will understand this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.04,1:53:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.54,1:53:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么也不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't understand anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.62,1:53:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个部落都讨厌我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole clan hates me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.42,1:53:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.79,1:54:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人 他们只看到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alien. That's all they see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.84,1:54:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I See you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.89,1:54:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是图鲲的兄弟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Brother of Tulkun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.73,1:54:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are one of us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.87,1:54:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到母的啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got my mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.04,1:54:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还带着小的 信号很强 范围四千\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother and calf. Strong signal. Range 4, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.79,1:54:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它弄到船上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it down, on the hull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.00,1:54:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comin' down, aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.42,1:54:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下水翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foils deployed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.74,1:55:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜水小队 两分钟后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sub teams, two minutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.41,1:55:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.07,1:55:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭舱门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hatches closed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.24,1:55:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 赶紧 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hustle! Hustle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.33,1:55:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员各就各位 两分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crews to their boats. Two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.37,1:55:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去赚一票大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make some bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.79,1:55:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,战船小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boat crews!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.25,1:55:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,解开固定装置 都解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get those tie downs off! Tie downs off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.13,1:55:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有船下水 都下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}All boats in! Boats in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.60,1:55:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.94,1:55:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're rollin'!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.51,1:56:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,深水炸弹准备进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by depth charges, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.06,1:56:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火 开火 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fire, fire, fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.29,1:56:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.37,1:56:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.92,1:56:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是回声定位传感器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are echolocation sensors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.59,1:56:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,图鲲认路用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How they navigate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.09,1:56:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要举到水面上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have to hold them out of the water, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.01,1:56:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然它们就聋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or they'll go deaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.09,1:56:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picadors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.47,1:56:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上 去呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in there! Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.80,1:56:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊 给我上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in there. Get up in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.65,1:57:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让那头雌性图鲲落单\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna cut the cow from the rest of the pod…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.85,1:57:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会用声波炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}using the sound cannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.91,1:57:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标是图鲲妈妈 因为幼崽游得慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They target the mother because the calf swims slowly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.63,1:57:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不会抛弃幼崽\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she won't leave the calf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.33,1:57:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不会反抗吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they ever fight back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.12,1:57:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 它们完全不会碰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, never seen 'em lift a fin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.13,1:57:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过皮很厚 不好杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough bastards to kill though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.34,1:57:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜水小队 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sub teams, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.47,1:57:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}And release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.47,1:57:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release, release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.85,1:57:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's our gal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.94,1:57:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target in sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.65,1:57:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,3-6号 准备鱼叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}3-6 is in hot with harpoons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.27,1:57:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.90,1:57:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从下方攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we go in from below{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.99,1:57:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,图鲲的腹部比较脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}where there's gaps in the armor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.70,1:58:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 上吧 靠近它\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go. Get up in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.37,1:58:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm goin' in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.45,1:58:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,再近一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me in close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.46,1:58:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold her steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.63,1:58:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入射程 一发炮弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}In range. Arm one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.34,1:58:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,装填 锁定目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arming, target lock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.17,1:58:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备 发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.64,1:58:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,两号准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two's in hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.01,1:58:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一发炮弹 - 装填\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Arm one. - Arming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.39,1:58:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.60,1:58:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干得好 再来一发 - 装填\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good strike. Arm two. - Arming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.23,1:58:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.69,1:58:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,打中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Booyah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.86,1:58:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.94,1:58:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,3-6号 请我们喝酒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}3-6, you owe us a beer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.37,1:58:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些气囊能给它减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, the bags slow her down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.53,1:58:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 强制它浮在水面上 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and keep her up at the surface. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.12,1:58:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,到它上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.41,1:58:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.87,1:58:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接落在它身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight up on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.50,1:58:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有三十米\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 meters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.38,1:58:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼叉上带了炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explosive-tipped harpoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.50,1:58:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有十米 送我过去 落到指定部位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten meters. Get me in there. Put me in the pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.67,1:58:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 稳一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now steady, steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.93,1:58:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持射程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.30,1:59:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住 稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold. Hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.06,1:59:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,线拉直了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Line's runnin'!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.10,1:59:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,站稳扶好啊 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to your ponytail, Colonel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.08,1:59:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力向后拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold back full!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.41,1:59:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,向后拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back full, aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.42,1:59:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.75,1:59:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.17,1:59:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸鱼叉直接射进了它的胸口\N{\fnArial\fs30}She takes an explosive harpoon to the chest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.97,1:59:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它居然还在跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's still runnin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.30,1:59:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.80,2:01:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,要取图鲲的腺体只能从下面走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to reach the gland is from below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.67,2:01:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,往上钻 穿透硬颚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We drill up through the hard palate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.89,2:01:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到大脑 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the brain. And…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.68,2:01:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是具有高度智慧的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are highly intelligent beings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.10,2:01:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能比我们都聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably smarter than us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.23,2:01:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那比我呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not smarter than me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.65,2:01:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿你比水平也太低了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is setting the bar very low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.27,2:01:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我有鱼叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm the one with the harpoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.40,2:01:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.50,2:01:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道图鲲比我们聪明？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know? That they're smarter than us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.75,2:01:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有更多的神经元和通路\N{\fnArial\fs30}More neurons, more pathways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.29,2:01:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不光比我们聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only are they smarter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.75,2:01:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,还感情丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're deeply emotional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.67,2:01:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,更有灵性\N{\fnArial\fs30}More spiritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.76,2:01:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, this region here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.22,2:01:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对应着人类的情绪中枢\N{\fnArial\fs30}corresponds with our emotional centers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.35,2:01:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的占比比人类要大得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}but proportionally it's much larger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.27,2:01:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,图鲲有音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have music, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.98,2:01:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有哲学\N{\fnArial\fs30}philosophy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.69,2:02:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有数学\N{\fnArial\fs30}mathematics, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.78,2:02:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有复杂的语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}complex language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.32,2:02:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.11,2:02:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,提取到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.03,2:02:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可就是钱呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.12,2:02:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,费那么大劲就为了这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what this is all about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.75,2:02:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是它\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.25,2:02:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不老精髓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amrita.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.17,2:02:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些图鲲也是倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad luck for the big guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.26,2:02:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们脑袋里的分泌物能停止人类衰老\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stuff just happens to stop human aging. Like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.34,2:02:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}stops it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.97,2:02:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一丁点不老精髓都是受无数人追捧的稀世珍宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ounce for ounce the single most valuable substance known to man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.80,2:02:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么一小管就能卖个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little vial here is worth like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.15,2:02:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,八千万\N{\fnArial\fs30}80 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.44,2:02:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,接住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.59,2:02:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.73,2:02:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.10,2:02:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为有不老精髓 我们才有设备和资金在潘多拉活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amrita is what's paying for everything here on Pandora now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.12,2:02:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括你做研究 我说的对吗 博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even your research. Ain't that right, Dr. G?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.70,2:02:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我酗酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why I drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.42,2:03:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只拿这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you take?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.92,2:03:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那别的 就不要了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you just waste the rest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.38,2:03:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,取掉气囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the bags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.42,2:03:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它沉下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's sink her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.88,2:03:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 留下气囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Leave the bags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.35,2:03:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们知道是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want 'em to know it was us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.81,2:03:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我的船做诱饵是要单收费的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I charge extra for bein' used as bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.47,2:03:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的名字叫洛瓦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Ro'a.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.35,2:03:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛瓦是我的心灵姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was my Spirit Sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.56,2:04:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她创造了那么多动听的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a composer of songs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.48,2:04:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,备受尊敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much revered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.86,2:04:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起唱歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would sing together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.86,2:04:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它等了好几个繁殖周期才生下这个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She waited many breeding cycles to have this calf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.03,2:04:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个部落都为它高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clan were so happy for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.83,2:04:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这算什么呢 特诺瓦里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, Tonowari?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.08,2:04:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.31,2:04:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心灵姐妹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Spirit Sister…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.99,2:04:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,和它的孩子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and her baby…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.43,2:04:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,都被天空人残忍地杀害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been murdered by the Sky People!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.28,2:04:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,战火已经烧到了我们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This war has come to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.32,2:04:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道天空人一直在捕猎图鲲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew about this hunting of our tulkun people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.84,2:04:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但从前他们在地平线外\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was over the horizon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.54,2:05:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常远\N{\fnArial\fs30}far away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.00,2:05:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 他们来这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it is here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.54,2:05:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.71,2:05:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得理解天空人的思维方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta understand how the Sky People think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.01,2:05:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本不在乎生态平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't care about the Great Balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.88,2:05:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用管天空人怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't answer to Sky People!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.59,2:05:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 都听他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. Listen to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.21,2:05:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,天空人是不会停手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sky People are not gonna stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.80,2:05:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is only the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.97,2:05:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要告诉图鲲 让它们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta tell your tulkun to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.18,2:05:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉它们 走得越远越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta tell them to go far away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.44,2:05:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.90,2:05:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我们一起生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live among us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.01,2:05:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你什么也没有学会\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you learn nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.19,2:05:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要战斗 要保护我们的兄弟姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will fight to protect our brothers and sisters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.53,2:05:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.32,2:05:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you attack, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.57,2:05:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you fight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.45,2:05:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会毁了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}then they will destroy you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.89,2:05:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会毁掉你们爱的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will destroy everything that you love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.85,2:05:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:43.80,2:05:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我说 - 不要战斗 不要战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You hear my words! - We will fight! We will fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.46,2:05:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear my words!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.63,2:05:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,都冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.79,2:05:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.25,2:05:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我父亲说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.34,2:05:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.51,2:05:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He speaks the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.77,2:06:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们告诉图鲲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell the tulkun{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.90,2:06:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦被这个打中\N{\fnArial\fs30}that if they're hit by one of these, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.48,2:06:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会被天空人追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're marked for death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:12.57,2:06:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以去拆掉追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And call for me, I'll silence it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.61,2:06:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让图鲲活着才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving their lives, that's all that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.58,2:06:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.41,2:06:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,解救你们的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.97,2:06:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉图鲲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the tulkun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.47,2:06:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.97,2:06:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.60,2:06:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:50.40,2:06:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}MaJake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.15,2:06:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会再袖手旁观了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not stand and do nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.57,2:06:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是陷阱 反抗就中计了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trap. They want us to hit back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.53,2:06:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抓的不是图鲲\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not hunting tulkun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.28,2:07:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hunting us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.34,2:07:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不能乱跑 好弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way you're rolling out of here, baby brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.42,2:07:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去提醒帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to warn Payakan about the pingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.38,2:07:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.55,2:07:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待在这里 哪儿也不许去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta keep your skxawng ass here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.64,2:07:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被赶出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's outcast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.85,2:07:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我没人能提醒它\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nobody to warn him but me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.77,2:07:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.81,2:07:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你总是让事情变复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}why do you always have to make things so hard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.44,2:07:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.65,2:07:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想问为什么我不像你一样完美？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean why can't I be the perfect son like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.61,2:07:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个完美的小战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The perfect little soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.86,2:07:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.78,2:07:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.28,2:07:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.45,2:07:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是我兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.95,2:07:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.04,2:07:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 它是你兄弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.71,2:07:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我才是你兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.79,2:07:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.21,2:07:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.50,2:07:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.59,2:07:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回来 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come back! - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.92,2:07:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要去找帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to Payakan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.19,2:08:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.48,2:08:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是洛阿克 洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Lo'ak! Lo'ak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.32,2:08:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.53,2:08:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克要去找帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak's going to find Payakan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.36,2:08:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.03,2:08:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.92,2:08:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有船员就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All crews to stations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.21,2:08:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 各位 开工赚钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, people. Come on. Let's make some money!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:42.67,2:08:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payakan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.09,2:08:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:45.51,2:08:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.10,2:08:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.18,2:08:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.27,2:08:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.57,2:08:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.40,2:09:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 别慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm. Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.07,2:09:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.53,2:09:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.46,2:09:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.87,2:09:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥 快来帮我一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro, come on! Help me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.79,2:09:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 船要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, the ship's coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.88,2:09:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're over there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.13,2:09:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.27,2:09:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.80,2:09:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快来帮忙 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, bro. - Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.64,2:09:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,去报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.93,2:09:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:28.26,2:09:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,去告诉他 快 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Dad! Just go! Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.60,2:09:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快去啊 - 洛阿克 快 快呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just do it. - Lo'ak, go! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.52,2:09:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 不是 恶狗 能听到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad. I mean, Devil Dog. Do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.52,2:09:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他们去哪儿了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see where they went?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.77,2:09:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是鹰眼 是否收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Eagle Eye, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.85,2:09:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们去礁石外面 - 嘿 洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They went outside the reef. - Yeah, Lo'ak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.40,2:09:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.65,2:09:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一头图鲲受到了攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're with a tulkun that's under attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.11,2:09:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,捕猎船就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killer ship's inbound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.36,2:09:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about two klicks out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.03,2:09:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身边有谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.11,2:09:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全都在 奥农和提蕾娅也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all of us. Aonung and Tsireya too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.45,2:09:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都在三兄岩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at Three Brothers Rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.99,2:09:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去找掩护 不要交战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get to cover, and you do not engage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.04,2:09:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗 听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? You hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.12,2:09:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动 我们这就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not engage. We're comin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.29,2:09:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.37,2:09:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,船越来越近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting closer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.50,2:09:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三 二 拉 - 拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three, two, pull! - Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.71,2:10:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids are under attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:01.55,2:10:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们有危险 他们在保护图鲲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids are under attack. They were defending a tulkun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.84,2:10:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的孩子也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your kids too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.05,2:10:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恶魔船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.26,2:10:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! We gotta go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.72,2:10:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿武器 发警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons. Sound the alarm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.64,2:10:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should stay back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.89,2:10:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ride!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.02,2:10:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.36,2:11:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜水小队 关闭舱门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sub teams, hatches close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.36,2:11:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two-minute warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.75,2:11:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥农\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aonung!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.75,2:11:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.96,2:11:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro, hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.34,2:11:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:28.51,2:11:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉呀 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.43,2:11:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有人一起用力 - 拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everybody! Together! - Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.18,2:11:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下可好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.81,2:11:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克的小崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully's kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.48,2:11:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's roll. Not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:43.23,2:11:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saddle up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.50,2:11:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,范围大概七百米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Range is 700 meters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.29,2:11:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪信号很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pinger signal is good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.75,2:12:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拉 用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull, harder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:03.29,2:12:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.75,2:12:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,使劲拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull, harder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:06.67,2:12:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.17,2:12:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来了 琪莉 出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's out! Kiri, it's out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.93,2:12:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 图克 快走 - 大家快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go. Tuk, go. - Go, everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.76,2:12:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.22,2:12:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,走那儿边 我来引开他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go that way! I'll draw them off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:15.06,2:12:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 洛阿克 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Lo'ak, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:16.86,2:12:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payakan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:18.10,2:12:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, dive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.64,2:12:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, dive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:21.06,2:12:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:31.86,2:12:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,范围三百米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Range 300.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.12,2:12:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,深水炸弹 准备发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready depth charges, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.99,2:12:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火 开火 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fire, fire, fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:43.08,2:12:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要用深水炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No depth charges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.75,2:12:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,索克斯比 听到没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scoresby, you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.09,2:12:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些孩子死了就没价值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These kids are worthless to me dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.34,2:12:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,都停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:54.34,2:12:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,围成一圈儿 把他们困在中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Circle out. Get a cordon around 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:57.26,2:12:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜水艇都下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your subs in the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.52,2:13:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜水小队下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sub teams, get wet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:50.98,2:13:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,螃蟹去右侧 包抄他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crabs flank right. Get around on 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:56.78,2:13:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟丢了 保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lose 'em. Stay on 'em now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.58,2:13:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,收起两翼 要进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planes up. We're goin' in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.83,2:14:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:32.94,2:14:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定目标 发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tone on lock. Two away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.14,2:15:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Tuk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.23,2:15:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.91,2:15:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.46,2:15:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target in sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.04,2:15:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.42,2:15:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:51.10,2:15:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 换渔网 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Switch net. - Switching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:52.61,2:15:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:12.42,2:16:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.21,2:16:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.13,2:16:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当心 - 图克 快逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch out! - Tuk, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.21,2:16:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿开手 拿开手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move your hand! Move your hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.30,2:16:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 割断它 - 快 快呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cut it! - Hurry, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:24.60,2:16:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 给我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid, get back here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.65,2:16:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.73,2:16:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下武器 - 快放下 放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put the weapon down! - Put it down. Put it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:35.69,2:16:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.61,2:16:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他 抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him! Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:40.82,2:16:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the weapon down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.07,2:16:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快扔掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:43.62,2:16:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下 - 把刀子扔掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put it down! - Drop the knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.16,2:16:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.37,2:16:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么？住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wat are you doing? Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:48.61,2:16:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 别伤害他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Don't hurt them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.29,2:16:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:52.37,2:16:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蜘蛛 - 兄弟 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spider! - Bro, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:54.86,2:16:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Great, cuz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:56.34,2:16:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好得很 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Never better. - Down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:59.17,2:17:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.26,2:17:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别反抗了 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock it off. Stay still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:01.34,2:17:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 安静点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.14,2:17:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他回驾驶舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back to the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:06.76,2:17:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep him there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.97,2:17:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己会走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going, I'm going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:10.52,2:17:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.81,2:17:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.15,2:17:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们拷起来 都拷上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuff 'em to the rail. All of 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.56,2:17:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.15,2:17:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 走 - 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. Move! - Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.61,2:17:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 他们会咬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch 'em. They bite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:21.86,2:17:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实跪下 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on your knees. On 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:22.95,2:17:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.03,2:17:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:26.28,2:17:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 另一只 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now the other. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:31.66,2:17:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be brave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:37.38,2:17:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Na'vi inbound!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:40.92,2:17:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 散开 武器准备 - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spread out. Weapons up. - Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:42.59,2:17:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,往左边 都散开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push left. Spread out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:46.72,2:17:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 让他们停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:51.89,2:17:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:55.48,2:17:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,二百七十米\N{\fnArial\fs30}300 yards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.49,2:18:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got our kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:03.99,2:18:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:05.45,2:18:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克 洛阿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuk. Lo'ak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:09.62,2:18:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 让你的朋友们都退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, tell your friends to stand down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:13.91,2:18:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要回孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want your kids back, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:16.04,2:18:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就单独过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you come out alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:20.38,2:18:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我可没有多少耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know better than to test my resolve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:23.42,2:18:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿克 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lo'ak! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.88,2:18:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:28.05,2:18:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我本来很关照你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took you under my wing, Jake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:30.56,2:18:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你背叛了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betrayed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:32.64,2:18:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:34.18,2:18:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜的男人和女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good men. Good women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:36.19,2:18:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会毫不犹豫地对你的孩子动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not hesitate to execute your kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.44,2:18:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:53.12,2:18:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:55.25,2:18:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人类杀害了图鲲\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are killers of tulkun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:57.75,2:18:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让他们偿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.13,2:18:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:00.37,2:19:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.28,2:19:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me that they want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:02.79,2:19:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,做这些都是为了找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what all this has been about, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:04.55,2:19:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎杀图鲲也是 绑架孩子们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hunting of our tulkun. The taking of our kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:10.10,2:19:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你带来的灾祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought this upon us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.47,2:19:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:17.39,2:19:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要去了结这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then it's me that has to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:25.40,2:19:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没有那么多耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Offer's fixin' to expire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.40,2:19:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it gonna be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:29.70,2:19:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,收起武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:31.33,2:19:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm comin' out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.59,2:19:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}MaJake, what is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:46.13,2:19:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}MaJake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:49.89,2:19:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,提高警惕 武器就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay tense, everybody. All weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:09.95,2:20:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以打中他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:11.99,2:20:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪会激怒他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit him now, they attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:15.49,2:20:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他上船再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till he's on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:44.27,2:20:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕亚坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payakan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:49.70,2:20:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:53.07,2:20:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.83,2:20:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open fire. Open fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.87,2:21:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.63,2:21:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快转向 - 转向\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come about! - Comin' about!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.34,2:21:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:09.97,2:21:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me a shot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:12.47,2:21:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:16.64,2:21:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:32.99,2:21:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:34.20,2:21:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.12,2:21:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:38.29,2:21:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,到射程之内 快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}get me in range. Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:49.25,2:21:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.34,2:21:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:59.01,2:22:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点开火 快开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open fire! Open fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:05.73,2:22:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully's inbound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:07.11,2:22:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,从上面盯住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want eyes on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.61,2:22:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走 准备升空\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go. Saddle up. We're up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:52.48,2:22:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都给我开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody shoot something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.13,2:23:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:55.46,2:23:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:06.73,2:24:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,去追他们 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get after them. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:25.20,2:24:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,进水了 戴面罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breach! Masks on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:27.45,2:24:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,氧气罩 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Masks on! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:55.90,2:24:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,换一个镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switching feeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:56.98,2:24:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？看到什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we got? What are we lookin' at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.33,2:25:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this guy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.62,2:25:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拉开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:15.09,2:25:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:19.05,2:25:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拉 快拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull! Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:30.23,2:25:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:44.88,2:25:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告受损情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damage report!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:46.33,2:25:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,二号和三号舱进水严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flooding. Compartment two and three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:48.66,2:25:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:19.11,2:26:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,左后方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Port bow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:21.32,2:26:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,左转弯 给我开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard port! Open fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:24.24,2:26:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要打中它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me a shot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:26.45,2:26:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got ya!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:45.01,2:26:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快断开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut us away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:46.76,2:26:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not responding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:48.22,2:26:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点把钢索切断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us off the cable!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:50.18,2:26:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看现在谁有鱼叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's got the harpoon now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:56.52,2:26:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back full!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:09.28,2:27:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,装弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reload!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:13.75,2:27:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要钢索了 别管他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the cable, you idiot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:16.79,2:27:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,船体不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dead in the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:19.33,2:27:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,进水了 上抽水泵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking on water. Pumps on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:21.71,2:27:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man your weapons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:23.17,2:27:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是认为自己比别的种族聪明吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were the intelligent species here, Scoresby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:25.96,2:27:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你那张臭嘴 加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut ya cakehole, Garvin.{\r}
