Dialogue: 0,2:35:13.98,2:35:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:15.39,2:35:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我指给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:17.02,2:35:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:18.11,2:35:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我带路 - 回我话 下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll show you. - Talk to me, Corporal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:20.31,2:35:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 上去 - 麻烦你拿出点诚意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Z, up top. - I need somethin', Jake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:22.07,2:35:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然后果自负\N{\fnArial\fs30}or there's gonna be consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:24.65,2:35:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:26.78,2:35:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:27.87,2:35:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. We gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:29.49,2:35:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:30.58,2:35:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:32.08,2:35:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 听着 听我说 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen. Listen. Listen to me. - No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:36.71,2:35:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:37.88,2:35:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 听我说 我们的女儿被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. Listen to me. They have our daughters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:40.17,2:35:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的女儿被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have our daughters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:44.67,2:35:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你和我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:48.09,2:35:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need you to be strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:50.18,2:35:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要挺住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:51.76,2:35:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:54.39,2:35:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要坚强起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:02.86,2:36:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:09.28,2:36:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去救女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go get our daughters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:25.59,2:36:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你陪着你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay with your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:27.63,2:36:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我也想一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I want to go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:32.05,2:36:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:33.72,2:36:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:39.06,2:36:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,先停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:41.36,2:36:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:43.40,2:36:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:46.19,2:36:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good. Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:49.66,2:36:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:50.91,2:36:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是为了这个来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what we came here for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:57.33,2:36:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你陪着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:58.87,2:36:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:00.79,2:37:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,警觉点 注意观察四周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads on a swivel, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:23.52,2:37:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:32.57,2:37:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:33.66,2:37:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,中部甲板 放潜水艇的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}The middle deck. Where they launch the subs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:35.70,2:37:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,中间有个井口\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's, like, a pool in the center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:38.08,2:37:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们在栏杆旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're at the forward railing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:41.79,2:37:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:45.96,2:37:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑得怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, Corporal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:48.09,2:37:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,船要沉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ship's going down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:49.34,2:37:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女儿也要完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your girls with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:52.26,2:37:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子本来不用死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boy didn't have to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:54.26,2:37:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是你自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought that on yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:03.10,2:38:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为能保护家人安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought you could keep your family safe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:04.94,2:38:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:08.32,2:38:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个办法让他们安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one way to keep them safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:13.91,2:38:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个了结吧 不然你会再少一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's get this over with before you lose another kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:28.71,2:38:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:11.92,2:39:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁受伤了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:13.01,2:39:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个老狗在吗？ - 报数\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zdinarsik, you copy? - Sound off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:14.68,2:39:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:16.72,2:39:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,普拉格 能听到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prager. You read?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:20.10,2:39:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面 上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes up. Eyes up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:30.40,2:39:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,追击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:33.94,2:39:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,向左边 去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push left. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:35.65,2:39:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去右边 包抄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push right. Get around on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:37.28,2:39:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁看到目标了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's got eyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:58.68,2:39:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,追\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:23.84,2:40:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}MaJake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:31.08,2:40:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:38.68,2:40:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:40.18,2:40:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就要来找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:32.94,2:41:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:36.98,2:41:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你姐姐在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Where's your sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:38.49,2:41:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she? Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:39.57,2:41:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边儿 在那边儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way. That way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:41.45,2:41:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stay behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:47.79,2:41:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:50.00,2:41:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快没时间了 下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Runnin' out of time here, Corporal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:53.25,2:41:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你失去了一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already lost one kid today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:54.92,2:41:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道还想失去第二个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really wanna lose another?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:56.30,2:41:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挑战我的耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not test me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:00.22,2:42:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kill him, Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:02.55,2:42:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:04.51,2:42:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下你的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:05.68,2:42:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 别听他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. Don't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:07.06,2:42:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:10.31,2:42:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,踢远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kick 'em away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:13.52,2:42:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:17.40,2:42:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:20.24,2:42:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己铐上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuff yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:21.40,2:42:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 别伤害她 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, don't hurt her, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:22.99,2:42:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 不许过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't… - Stand there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:24.70,2:42:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't! - Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:26.53,2:42:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一步也不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:28.16,2:42:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,铐上 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuffs on. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:30.08,2:42:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:32.29,2:42:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't hurt her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:37.00,2:42:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:39.17,2:42:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:42.76,2:42:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为我在乎那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think I care about some kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:46.22,2:42:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:48.06,2:42:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甚至不算同一个物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not even the same species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:50.64,2:42:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 求你了 别…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just please don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:52.14,2:42:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't hurt her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:53.23,2:42:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你了 放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just please let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:54.85,2:42:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你了 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't. - Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:56.02,2:42:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要杀他 - 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't kill him. - Listen to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:57.73,2:42:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,放她走 别伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go. Don't hurt her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:59.44,2:43:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你别杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, don't kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:01.61,2:43:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你儿子换我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A son for a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:06.11,2:43:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't hurt her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:09.54,2:43:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:11.08,2:43:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你放她走好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please just let her go, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:12.83,2:43:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:16.20,2:43:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:26.09,2:43:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪莉 琪莉 琪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiri… Kiri. Kiri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:35.27,2:43:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:37.15,2:43:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 快带他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider, get 'em out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:39.36,2:43:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:40.44,2:43:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 图克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys. Tuk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:41.57,2:43:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我一条命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you a death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:44.57,2:43:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:45.65,2:43:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mama. - Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:46.74,2:43:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:47.82,2:43:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:49.83,2:43:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会走吧 杰克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not leaving, are you, Jake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:51.41,2:43:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事的 - 你知道我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - Knowin' I'm out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:54.41,2:43:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不会住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowin' that I'll never stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:56.87,2:43:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:58.25,2:44:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我找到你 我就会杀光你们全家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I do, I'll kill your whole family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:02.09,2:44:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:05.13,2:44:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,该结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's get it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:16.89,2:44:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:21.73,2:44:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 烧过来了 - 回去 回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's coming! - Back. Back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:23.44,2:44:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到船上去 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back to the ship. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:24.74,2:44:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,图克 快游 快游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuk, swim, swim.{\r}
