Dialogue: 0,2:58:25.78,2:58:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你儿子换我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A son for a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:44.72,2:58:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐珠总会数到最后一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every songcord must have a last bead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:12.16,2:59:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲要保护家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A father protects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:15.29,2:59:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他才有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what gives him meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:45.20,2:59:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威人说能量都是借来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The People say that all energy is only borrowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:50.49,2:59:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,终有一天要还回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day you have to give it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:06.22,3:00:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃 她心中放着所有的儿女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eywa holds all her children in her heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:11.47,3:00:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得所有的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is ever lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:16.10,3:00:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neteyam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:17.73,3:00:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neteyam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:38.96,3:00:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family and I, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:41.38,3:00:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天就要搬走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll move on tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:43.17,3:00:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,去很远的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far away from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:45.72,3:00:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子和我们的祖先在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son lies with our ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:48.72,3:00:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也是梅卡伊纳人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Metkayina now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:57.06,3:00:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:00.48,3:01:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们加入了海洋部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are Sea People now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:04.48,3:01:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是我们的家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:06.96,3:02:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:08.84,3:02:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看我捉到了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what I caught!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:12.93,3:02:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条鱼可真大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's a big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:14.64,3:02:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在水池里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in that pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:16.43,3:02:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在石头后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:19.27,3:02:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right where you said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:24.40,3:02:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:27.07,3:02:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么哭了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you crying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:30.36,3:02:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见到你太高兴了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just happy to see you, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:34.58,3:02:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你我也很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy to see you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:38.79,3:02:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 你试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. You try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:42.67,3:02:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:45.42,3:02:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还有鱼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave any for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:46.92,3:02:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 可能有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:54.60,3:02:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我射中了 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Check that out. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:03.77,3:03:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:06.15,3:03:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃亡不能让我的家人安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't save my family by running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:09.40,3:03:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是我们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:11.45,3:03:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our fortress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:14.32,3:03:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是我们守护的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we make our stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:22.45,3:03:31.29,Title,0,0,0,0,,《阿凡达2：水之道》
Dialogue: 0,3:03:46.53,3:03:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我以为我可以保护好你 不为了我而赎罪 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I thought I could protect you from paying for my sins ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:57.14,3:04:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我已经在这片土地上行走了足够长的时间 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And I been walking this earth long enough that death's a gift ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:08.36,3:04:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 姑娘 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, girl ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:11.06,3:04:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在这世上隐忍的生活 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Been living this life so patient ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:15.55,3:04:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 直到再次遇见你 这就是我们所面对的 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Until I see you again, it's war we're facing ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:23.15,3:04:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我知道如果我注定一死 我唯一的选择仍是捍卫 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I know that if I die, my only choice is still defending ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:30.05,3:04:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无论旁人说什么 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ No matter what they say ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:33.57,3:04:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我对你的爱胜过那些天兵天将的力量 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ My love for you is greater than their powers and their armies from above ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:41.81,3:04:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你赐予了我力量 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You give me strength ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:48.73,3:04:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无论怎样我与你同在 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm with you either way ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:53.94,3:05:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 假如我死了 假如我留在这里 请赐予我力量 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ If I die, if I stay, give me strength ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:03.93,3:05:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无论怎样我与你同在 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm with you either way ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:09.10,3:05:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再也没什么可失去 再也没有痛苦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Nothing's lost, no more pain ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:12.20,3:05:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你赐予了我力量 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just give me strength ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:16.12,3:05:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 赐予了我力量 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Give me strength ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:18.97,3:05:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无论怎样我与你同在 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm with you either way ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:24.07,3:05:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再也没什么可失去 再也没有痛苦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Nothing's lost, no more pain ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:27.30,3:05:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你赐予了我力量 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just give me strength ∮{\r}
